{296}{Augh!  You haven't the fare!  If I miss the tide because of ye wasting me time...  I'll get ye...  Ye can count on it!  Now get ye gone from me vessel! }{Augh!  You haven't the fare!  If I miss the tide because of ye wasting me time...  I'll get ye...  Ye can count on it!  Now get ye gone from me vessel! }{}{}{}{re -5}
