{308}{No, no.  I'm afraid I can't just take ye with me.  Only paying passengers may board me fine ship.}{No, no.  I'm afraid I can't just take ye with me.  Only paying passengers may board me fine ship.}{}{}{}{}
{309}{}{}{}{}{}{}
{310}{If ye can't afford the fare, well then, I can't afford to take ye either. Come back when ye got the coins... Good bye to ye.}{If ye can't afford the fare, well then, I can't afford to take ye either. Come back when ye got the coins... Good bye to ye.}{}{}{}{}
