{316}{ ...Well...  Ye do appear to be strong of body.  I guess ye could work for yer passage.  I be leaving for Norleigh on this very tide.  I'll let ye work your way there, if ye can leave now.}{ ...Well...  Ye do appear to have quite a, um... body.  Perhaps you could "work" for yer passage.  If ye know what I be sayin'.  I be leaving for Norleigh on this very tide.  I'll let ye pay for yer passage by tending to me an' me men.  [looking anxious to be on his way]  Can ye can leave now?}{}{}{}{}
